  "referenceNumber": "RUS0142",
  "remarks": "\n“Secretary” of the ‘Central Election Commission’ of the so-called ‘Luhansk People’s Republic’. In this capacity, she participated in the organisation of the so-called ‘elections’ of 11 November 2018 in the so-called ‘Luhansk People’s Republic’, and thereby actively supported  and implemented actions and policies which undermine the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine.  \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
